  "details": "Description\n\nI bought some VR Credits a while back and it was supposed to be a 24-hour wait before being able to by Credits... It's been over a week now since I have had the limit of credits being bought\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nUhm... Not sure You'd have to try to rework the purchase system. I think the limit is a good idea, but should re-work it so it doesnt bug out and actually has a 24 hour limit timer to the affected players\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-06_18-47-26.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_38c87f36-6ec0-42bf-b7ff-6a62c4af1b0f/1/file)",
